        "id": 11059
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-04-04T18:57:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Looking at the CL description, it looks like this is the point of the CL, but it\u0027s disappointing that it seems to have a fairly broad impact. Are the GCC warnings all over the place or localized to just a few sites?",
      "parentUuid": "22debc59_13ffea08",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 215,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 215,
        "endChar": 15
      },
