      "lineNbr": 215,
      "author": {
        "id": 3375938
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-04-04T20:13:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sure, but do we have any benchmarks that we can test to measure performance deltas?\n\nI understand that this is perf-sensitive code, but if the difference isn\u0027t observable, how much does it matter?",
      "parentUuid": "24163447_7e2be99d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 215,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 215,
        "endChar": 15
      },
      "revId": "7f190dd04a7ad98850854fdc0209640ffe411942",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
