      "writtenOn": "2024-04-04T20:17:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Gotcha. Skia has lots of benchmarks. Off the cuff I can\u0027t necessarily point to one benchmark which will demonstrate the performance impact of adding extra logic to all SkVx work. If you want to experiment with it, use `nanobench`.\n\nYou can run it via `out/Release/nanobench -m mytestname`. Omitting the command line arguments will just run all tests.\n\nBenchmarks are in the `bench` directory if you want to skim them for something that seems pertinent.",
      "parentUuid": "f7eb6aba_bb090ff9",
